ub.com/users/yashk2810/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14262417?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yashk2810","id":14262417,"login":"yashk2810","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjYyNDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"Given our current model of how device assignment as it interacts with JIT, this may be working as expected, but I suspect some users would find this to be a surprising breakage of JIT-invariance. Is there anything we can do to change this?\n\nRelated to #26000.\n\n```python\nimport jax\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\njax.config.update('jax_num_cpu_devices', 2)\n\ncpu1, cpu2 = jax.devices()\n\nx1 = jnp.arange(4, device=cpu1)\nx2 = jnp.arange(4, device=cpu2)\n\nfunc = jnp.zeros_like\n\nassert func(x1).device == x1.device  # passes\nassert jax.jit(func)(x1).device == x1.device  # passes\n\nassert func(x2).device == x2.device  # passes\nassert jax.jit(func)(x2).device == x2.device  # fails\n```","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":3,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/26040/comments","created_at":"2025-01-22T19:27:13Z","events_url":